Floorplan keyboard search for local generated viewers.

After generating a viewer with the matching search implementation, run from the repository root:

    git apply --check scripts/floorplan-keyboard-search.patch
    git apply scripts/floorplan-keyboard-search.patch
    node --input-type=module -e 'import {readFileSync,writeFileSync} from "node:fs"; import {withPolicy} from "./floorplan/page-safety.mjs"; const file="floorplan/index.html"; writeFileSync(file,withPolicy(readFileSync(file,"utf8"),"local"));'

The last command refreshes the viewer's inline script hashes for direct file access.
The local Floorplan server also recalculates these hashes when serving the viewer.
If the patch no longer applies cleanly, review the new generator's code before porting it.

